order-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-card)]"><div class="grid gap-2 px-4 pt-4 pb-3 sm:px-5"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span><span class="inline-flex h-[22px] items-center gap-1.5 rounded px-2 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.04em] whitespace-nowrap bg-[var(--color-accent)]/15 text-[var(--color-accent)]">Working</span></span><span class="inline-flex h-[22px] items-center rounded-md border border-[var(--color-border)] bg-[var(--color-bg)] px-2 text-xs font-medium whitespace-nowrap text-[var(--color-muted)]">linear · ticket queue</span></div><h3 id="work-item-w-claimed" class="text-base leading-snug font-semibold text-[var(--color-fg)]">Item w-claimed</h3><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm text-[var(--color-fg-2)]">On w-claimed: <q class="italic text-[var(--color-fg-2)]">Triage this Linear close summary.</q></p></div><div class="grid gap-2 border-t px-4 py-3.5 sm:px-5 border-[var(--color-border)]"><h4 class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--color-muted)]">Drafting a plan</h4><ol aria-label="Progress" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><li aria-current="step" class="inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-2.5 text-[13px] border-[var(--color-accent-line)] bg-[var(--color-accent-soft)] text-[var(--color-accent)]">Plan<span class="sr-only">, under way</span></li><li class="inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-2.5 text-[13px] border-[var(--color-border)] text-[var(--color-muted)]">Your approval<span class="sr-only">, next</span></li><li class="inline-flex h-7 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-2.5 text-[13px] border-[var(--color-border)] text-[var(--color-muted)]">Run<span class="sr-only">, next</span></li></ol><p class="text-[13px] text-[var(--color-muted)]">The plan comes to you before anything runs.</p></div><div class="px-4 sm:px-5 [&amp;&gt;p:not(:empty)]:pb-3"><p role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" class="empty:sr-only text-xs leading-snug break-words text-[var(--color-muted)